      "data": {
        "title": "Behavior",
        "body": "edgeClassRegistry loads the default collection; deriveEdgeClassFromGraphPayload derives each rule. The editor and validator share edgeLegality. Core classes live in the content repository, so changing runtime code alone cannot publish a new class rule.",
